      "s": "Bloomberg Tech",
      "t": "Hugging Face Co-Founder on Open-Source Robot, Reports of Nvidia Deal",
      "d": "Hugging Face unveiled MicroDuck, the company’s new open-source robot that can walk, talk, and roller-skate. Hugging Face co-founder and Chief Science Officer Thomas Wolf discusses surging demand for robotics and open-source AI, and says the company is currently selling roughly one MicroDuck every four seconds. He also declined to comment on reports that Nvidia is nearing a roughly $13 billion deal",
